### scorpio context broker - Create Subscription

POST http://localhost:9090/ngsi-ld/v1/subscriptions/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/ld+json
NGSILD-Tenant: smartcity
NGSILD-Path: /ClimateQuarter

{
  "type": "Subscription",
  "entities": [
    {
      "type": "climate-quarter-house"
    }
  ],
  "watchedAttributes": [
    "powerHouseConsumption",
    "powerGrid"
  ],
  "notification": {
    "attributes": [
      "powerHouseConsumption",
      "powerGrid"
    ],
    "endpoint": {
      "uri": "http://quantumleap:8668/v2/notify",
      "accept": "application/json"
    },
    "format": "normalized"
  },
  "throttling": 1,
  "description": "Subscription to monitor changes in powerHouseConsumption and powerGrid for all devices.",
  "@context": [
    "http://context-hoster/ngsi-ld-core-context-v1.8.jsonld"
  ]
}

### scorpio context broker - Query subscriptions

GET http://localhost:9090/ngsi-ld/v1/subscriptions/
Link: <http://context-hoster/ngsi-ld-core-context-v1.8.jsonld>; rel="http://www.w3.org/ns/json-ld#context"
NGSILD-Tenant: smartcity
NGSILD-Path: /
Accept: application/ld+json

### Data mock - Send sensor data for device cqHouse01

POST http://localhost:7897/iot/ul?k=example-api-key&i=cqHouse01 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: text/plain
NGSILD-Tenant: smartcity
NGSILD-Path: /ClimateQuarter

logvar.di_p_haus|12|logvar.di_p_netz|333|logvar.di_p_solar|300|logvar.di_p_batt_dc|80|logvar.di_p_bat_ac|22.5|logvar.di_p_batt_soc|2000


